content.p:
 The debtor is obliged, subject to criminal penalties for failing to do so (Art. 169 SCC

 SR 311.0
	), to ensure that the assets recorded are preserved or replaced by equivalent assets; however, he may use or consume as many of the assets as, at the discretion of the debt enforcement officer, are necessary to support himself and his family.

item.p:
